  "failure_reason": "O_EXCL collision on motion_0000.json when entering the second observation phase. This prevented the5s target observation and SpeedSet restoration; it does not itself identify any physical junction change. Original uncertain_no_retry outcome is retained, not converted to full move success.",
  "conclusions": [
