    "Post-Stop112.03s contains no large-current event but current noise remains: mean−103.057pA/std25.005pA, minimum−322.527pA. Last30s mean−104.544/std31.154pA, Zslope+1.020pm/s/residual16.087pm; last10s+1.620pm/s/residual15.669pm.",
    "Post-target rest is NOT uniformly quiet: intermittent current-noise bursts and Z level/variance changes of tens ofpm are visible, including a brief higher-Z/quieter interval near2754–2757s. Absence of>=400pA does not erase these local junction/feedback/electronic dynamics. They predate any I01shaper and must not be attributed to it.",
    "The record contains no measured sustained overload or direct image evidence establishing a new globally bad tip after202. It also cannot prove the imaging response stayed unchanged during motion or that the current target was fully stationary in a microscopic sense.",
